units    : SI on disk, converted ONLY at the SwiftUI render boundary via the shared `Units` facade (ADR-005,
           SI-cutover). Web wire is km / kmh / kWh / hours; the model stores meters / m·s⁻¹ / watt-hours /
           seconds (km×1000, kmh→m/s, kWh×1000, h×3600). Currency / counts / ratios / kg / day-equivalents
           pass through verbatim (not unit-converted), matching the web page exactly.

