NAVIGATION NOTE (no predecessor bypass, covenant #7)
  The web route /lifetime-stats had NO existing AppRoute. A new case `.lifetimeStats` was added to
  Sources/App/AppRoute.swift (pathSegment "lifetime-stats", SF Symbol "trophy.fill", group .insights —
  the same Insights group the web page sits in alongside Statistics/FleetCompare/TCO). AppRouteParser
  resolves "/lifetime-stats" to it automatically (firstSegment match), so the page is deep-linkable and
  appears in the Insights sidebar group. No existing case was renamed or displaced; the parser aliases,
  every sibling registration, and the registry chain are otherwise untouched. LifetimeStatsRouteRegistration
  is composed into the route-host chain in TeslaSyncApp.swift right after StatisticsRouteRegistration. The
  @Observable model is built @MainActor in the registration enum and captured, mirroring the sibling enums.

